<p><em>We are on the verge of finally discovering it -</em> [CORRUPTED] <em>equation of everything. The mathematics is working perfectly; too perfectly, perhaps, for me to remain comfortable with this experiment much longer.</em> [CORRUPTED] <em>natural laws, behaviors, and forces?</em></p>
