</blockquote>
<p>My theory hinges around one assumption, and that is that each world with sapient life has its own instance of 3930. In short, I think that a unified scientific theory/model of the universe (A theory of everything) would predict the existence of Pattern Screamers. Once this theory of everything is spread around and shared within that planets scientific community, so too does the knowledge of Pattern Screamers quickly spread. This causes that planets 3930 instance to quickly grow, engulfing the entire planet.</p>

